    "content": "\n      <h2>Establishing Commercial Legitimacy in the UAE Market</h2>\n      <p>Setting up a new corporate entity in Dubai, whether in mainland DED or prestigious free zones such as DIFC, DMCC, or ADGM, involves legal incorporation, trade licensing, and bank account opening. In the UAE business ecosystem, official physical corporate stationery remains mandatory for bank authorizations, government filings, and client contracts.</p>\n\n      <h2>The 5 Mandatory Stationery Items for Every UAE Company</h2>\n      <h3>1. Official Self-Inking Company Stamp</h3>\n      <p>The company seal is legally required for signing commercial leases, corporate bank account onboarding, customs clearance, and official labor contracts. It must clearly display your registered trade license company name (in English and Arabic) and license number.</p>\n\n      <h3>2. 120 GSM Laser-Guaranteed Official Letterheads</h3>\n      <p>Official contracts, board resolutions, and tender proposals require executive letterhead paper. Specify smooth 120 GSM laser-guaranteed paper that runs seamlessly through desktop office laser printers without toner bubbling or paper warping.</p>\n\n      <h3>3. Matching Peel-and-Seal Corporate Envelopes</h3>\n      <p>Matching branded envelopes in standard DL (for folded A4 letters), C5 (for A5 cards), and C4 (for unfolded A4 contracts) with internal security tinting for confidential correspondence.</p>\n\n      <h3>4. Executive Business Cards</h3>\n      <p>High-gsm business cards for company directors and commercial business development representatives, ensuring a commanding first impression at networking forums.</p>\n\n      <h3>5. Die-Cut Interlocking Presentation Folders</h3>\n      <p>Heavyweight 350 GSM presentation folders with interior document pockets and business card slits, essential for presenting formal proposals, pitchbooks, and audited accounts.</p>\n\n      <p>Discover corporate packages on our <a href=\"/services/letterheads-printing-dubai\">Letterheads & Stationery Page</a> or explore our <a href=\"/printing-solutions/corporate-stationery-branding\">Corporate Stationery Branding Solutions</a>.</p>\n    "
