    "content": "<h2>The Trade Show Capital of the Middle East</h2>\n<p>Each year, Dubai World Trade Centre (DWTC) hosts mega-events including GITEX Global, Arab Health, Gulfood, Beautyworld, and The Big 5. International exhibitors frequently face transit delays, damaged marketing collateral, or last-minute marketing adjustments upon landing in the UAE. Having a reliable local commercial print partner in Al Quoz is critical to trade show ROI.</p>\n\n<h2>Essential Print Collaterals for Trade Show Booths</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Anti-Curl Retractable Roll-Up Banners (85×200 cm & 100×200 cm):</strong> Printed on 440 GSM opaque blockout polypropylene with heavy aluminum double-foot cassettes. No edge curling under hall spotlights.</li>\n  <li><strong>Magnetic Pop-Up Media Backdrops (3×3 & 4×3 Curved/Straight):</strong> Seamless high-resolution graphics panels secured via magnetic strips on lightweight aluminum scissor lattices.</li>\n  <li><strong>Foam Board & Forex Panel Mounts (5mm & 10mm):</strong> Ultra-lightweight direct UV-printed rigid panels engineered to adhere directly to shell-scheme octanorm exhibition walls using heavy-duty velcro or double-sided tape.</li>\n  <li><strong>Exhibition Handout Leaflets & Catalogs:</strong> 150 GSM silk leaflets for mass distribution and 250 GSM laminated corporate lookbooks for qualified VIP buyers.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>DWTC Venue Regulations & Pre-Press Guidelines</h2>\n<ol>\n  <li><strong>Color Calibration (CMYK / Fogra 39):</strong> Exhibition hall fluorescent and LED floodlights cause extreme color shifts if RGB artwork is converted without calibrated ICC profiles.</li>\n  <li><strong>Safe Zone Clearance:</strong> For 85x200cm roll-up banners, ensure logos and text are kept at least 50mm away from the top clamp and 100mm away from the bottom roller base.</li>\n  <li><strong>Direct Hall Delivery Coordination:</strong> Provide your Hall Number, Stand / Booth Number, and onsite coordinator phone number for direct hall dispatch.</li>\n</ol>"
